%%{init: {'theme': 'default', 'themeVariables': {'fontSize': '13px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant TPM as TPM
    participant CoCo as Cortex Code + Tooling
    participant Jira as Jira
    participant SF as Snowflake
    participant Atlan as Atlan
    participant QS as QuickSight

    TPM->>CoCo: Select ticket for triage
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over CoCo: Step 1: Snapshot
    CoCo->>Jira: Fetch full ticket state
    Jira-->>CoCo: Ticket fields + comments
    CoCo->>CoCo: Save to snapshots/
    end

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over CoCo: Step 2: Assess
    CoCo->>CoCo: Run _assess.py
    CoCo->>SF: Check asset availability
    SF-->>CoCo: Column/table metadata
    CoCo->>Atlan: Search referenced assets
    Atlan-->>CoCo: Asset links + lineage
    CoCo->>CoCo: Calculate RICE, conformance, team
    end

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over CoCo: Step 3: Investigate
    CoCo->>Jira: Search related tickets (JQL)
    Jira-->>CoCo: Duplicates + prior work
    CoCo->>SF: Reporter lookup (dim_workers)
    SF-->>CoCo: Role, department, active status
    CoCo->>Atlan: Asset lineage traversal
    Atlan-->>CoCo: Upstream/downstream objects
    opt QuickSight Access Ticket
        CoCo->>CoCo: Check quicksight_users.csv
        CoCo->>QS: Describe dashboard permissions
        QS-->>CoCo: Dashboard owners
    end
    opt RBAC / Access Ticket
        CoCo->>SF: SHOW GRANTS chain analysis
        SF-->>CoCo: Role hierarchy
    end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 255, 224)
    Note over TPM: Step 4: Review Gate
    CoCo->>TPM: Present findings + recommendation
    TPM->>TPM: Review and decide action
    end

    alt TPM requests changes
        TPM->>CoCo: Request additional investigation
        CoCo->>CoCo: Re-investigate
        CoCo->>TPM: Updated findings
    end

    TPM->>CoCo: Confirm action

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over CoCo: Step 5: Post Triage
    CoCo->>Jira: Update summary + priority
    CoCo->>Jira: Post triage comment (10-point standard)
    CoCo->>Jira: Post estimated RICE (separate comment)
    CoCo->>Jira: Link related tickets
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
    Note over TPM,Jira: Step 6: Route
    alt Close
        CoCo->>Jira: Post close message + transition
    else Waiting for Customer
        CoCo->>Jira: Transition to Waiting for Customer
    else Assign in DATA
        CoCo->>Jira: Set assignee
    else Handoff to DNA
        CoCo->>Jira: Post handoff comment
        TPM->>Jira: Manually move ticket (DATA to DNA)
        TPM->>CoCo: Provide new DNA key
        CoCo->>Jira: Set Team, Component, Assignee on DNA key
    end
    end

    TPM->>CoCo: Direct to next ticket
